=== INVOICEFORGE - CODE REVIEW BACKLOG ===
Date: 2026-06-17

======================================================================
CRITICAL
======================================================================

1. No authentication at all
   - API has zero auth, CORS is '*', .env contains real company financial data (NPWP, bank account, etc.)
   - Any network access to this server means full read/write access to all data.

2. No concurrency protection
   - JSON file storage uses "read -> modify -> write" with no locking.
   - Simultaneous requests cause data loss / race conditions.

======================================================================
HIGH
======================================================================

3. Hardcoded port in backend/src/index.ts:78
   - port = 3001 hardcoded instead of reading from .env (where PORT=3001 is defined).

4. Synchronous file write during uploads in pic.route.ts:87
   - Uses fs.writeFileSync (blocking) instead of fs.promises.writeFile.

5. Firebase analytics imported but never used (frontend/src/lib/firebase.ts)
   - analytics is never consumed by any component. Unnecessary bundle bloat.

6. Astro node adapter commented out in astro.config.mjs
   - adapter config is commented out; astro build cannot produce a deployable server.

======================================================================
MEDIUM
======================================================================

7. Widespread 'any' types in Preact components
   - useState<any>(null), any[] for arrays. No interfaces defined for Invoice, Client, PIC, Settings.

8. No pagination on list endpoints
   - GET /api/clients, /api/pics, /api/invoices return full dataset.
   - Will degrade as data grows.

9. Missing 'key' props on mapped elements
   - Several components lack key props (e.g., <option> elements in InvoiceForm.tsx).

10. useEffect missing dependencies in InvoiceEditor.tsx
    - fetchInitialData not in dependency array; client/pic sync effect incomplete deps.

======================================================================
LOW
======================================================================

11. console.log left in production code (pic.service.ts, pic.route.ts)
    - Debugging statements should be removed or routed through proper logger.

12. No request size limits on file uploads
    - POST /:id/upload-signature has no size limit check.

13. Dashboard revenue chart is hardcoded placeholder
    - Values [40, 70, 45, 90, 65, 80] not connected to real data.

14. Hardcoded IDR locale in InvoiceForm.tsx
    - Uses 'id-ID' locale and 'IDR' prefix instead of formatCurrency utility.

15. .env committed with real company credentials
    - Sensitive data (bank account, NPWP, etc.) in version control.
